  "fields": {
    "title": "Sustainability",
    "textContent": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Description",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Sustainable webdesign refers to practices and principles aimed at creating websites that minimize environmental impact. The goal is to reduce the energy consumption and carbon footprint associated with the development, hosting, and use of websites. Some key aspects of sustainable webdesign are efficient coding, optimization, green hosting, reduced data transfer, longevity and ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "4TzAZFehkMPRfclxZU7jhz",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "accessibility",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ". Even something as simple as a dark mode for the interface of an app can reduce the amount of strain on the battery of a smartphone or tablet, thus reducing energy consumption.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Many people assume that websites already are sustainable publishing format, but this is not exactly the case. Every website that’s online is hosted on a server. When you access the site, the web browser requests the file from the server and sends it back to the browser. Even if this process usually proceeds so quickly that we hardly notice it, it produces CO₂.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "superscript"
                }
              ],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "The carbon footprint of a website is multilayered, but one way of thinking about it is that intentional, lighter weight websites are quicker to load, and therefore less wasteful.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "27U5iefn01ixggvxfBoUJy",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "[1]",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "blockquote",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "paragraph",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "»Just as it’s an architect’s responsibility to think about the carbon cost of the things they design, it should be every digital designer’s responsibility to think about the same thing for the websites and apps they make.« ",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                },
                {
                  "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
                  "data": {
                    "target": {
                      "sys": {
                        "id": "6CNMyPNd9SbiCikJVgUae3",
                        "type": "Link",
                        "linkType": "Entry"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "[2]",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "superscript"
                        }
                      ],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "The digital industry is responsible for 2-5% of global emissions, more than the aviation industry. If the Internet were a country it would be one of the top five polluters. That is why in 2023 the ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "uri": "https://www.w3.org/community/sustyweb/"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Sustainable Web Design Community Group",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " published a draft of ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "uri": "https://w3c.github.io/sustyweb/"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Web Sustainability Guidelines (WSG) 1.0",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ", which explain how to design and implement digital products and services that put people and the planet first. This guidelines provide best practices and recommendations for reducing the environmental impact of web development and design, such as minimizing data transfer, optimizing images or using green hosting.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "7lvAl6DGcZ5PFDMfp2mMmT",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "[3]",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Background",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Even though sustainable web design is a rather young concept, which has become increasingly known in recent years, the concept of sustainable design in general is not new. In architecture sustainable design gained importance during the 1960s and 70s, with the rise of the environmental movement. Architects like Buckminster Fuller paved the way for a new era of sustainable design, emphasizing the importance of energy efficiency, renewable materials, and holistic design approaches. In the decades that followed, sustainable design principles became increasingly mainstream, and today they are considered an essential component of any modern building project.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "2IDQBbkS4UVlGCQnE9eaaV",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "[4]",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "But of course not only in webdesign and architecture sustainability is an important aspect of the design process. Other disciplines like product design, fashion design or graphic design also came up with different approaches on minimizing their environmental impact.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
